        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "7nIni",
          "name": "policyContent",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FAF8F3",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 48,
          "padding": [
            80,
            200
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ACLWS",
              "name": "introText",
              "fill": "#2C2418",
              "content": "月瀬庵（以下「当館」）は、お客様の個人情報の保護を重要な責務と考え、以下のとおりプライバシーポリシーを定め、個人情報の適切な取り扱いに努めます。",
              "lineHeight": 2.2,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "300"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "mC6ov",
              "name": "section1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "9srQJ",
                  "name": "sec1Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "1. 個人情報の定義",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "anOsI",
                  "name": "sec1Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館が取得する個人情報とは、お名前、ご住所、電話番号、メールアドレス、その他お客様を識別できる情報をいいます。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ywmCp",
              "name": "section2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "scd0d",
                  "name": "sec2Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "2. 個人情報の収集",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "v5BzF",
                  "name": "sec2Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館は、以下の場合に個人情報を収集いたします。\n・ご予約のお申し込み時\n・お問い合わせフォームのご利用時\n・メールマガジンのご登録時\n・アンケートへのご回答時",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "w9HKj",
              "name": "section3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "x6BX7",
                  "name": "sec3Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "3. 個人情報の利用目的",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "2VdRw",
                  "name": "sec3Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "収集した個人情報は、以下の目的で利用いたします。\n・ご予約の確認およびご連絡\n・サービスの提供および改善\n・お問い合わせへのご対応\n・当館からのお知らせやキャンペーン情報のご案内\n・統計データの作成（個人を特定できない形式）",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "7qQsI",
              "name": "section4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p9ksj",
                  "name": "sec4Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "4. 個人情報の第三者提供",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Gbjy1",
                  "name": "sec4Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館は、法令に基づく場合を除き、お客様の同意なく個人情報を第三者に提供いたしません。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qwO0w",
              "name": "section5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rE2TV",
                  "name": "sec5Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "5. 個人情報の管理",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gD2kq",
                  "name": "sec5Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館は、個人情報の漏洩、滅失、毀損を防止するため、適切なセキュリティ対策を講じます。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "gT8yW",
              "name": "section6",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UBSVG",
                  "name": "sec6Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "6. Cookieの使用について",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "G0LM7",
                  "name": "sec6Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館のウェブサイトでは、サービス向上のためCookieを使用しております。Cookieの使用を希望されない場合は、ブラウザの設定により無効にすることができます。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "GQ7es",
              "name": "section7",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y28rQ",
                  "name": "sec7Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "7. プライバシーポリシーの変更",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FUOPx",
                  "name": "sec7Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "当館は、必要に応じて本ポリシーを変更することがあります。変更後のポリシーは、当ウェブサイトに掲載した時点から効力を生じます。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "bO2BK",
              "name": "section8",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "e8JYj",
                  "name": "sec8Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "8. お問い合わせ窓口",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "9j2gL",
                  "name": "sec8Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "content": "個人情報の取り扱いに関するお問い合わせは、下記までご連絡ください。\n\n月瀬庵\n〒250-0522 神奈川県足柄下郡箱根町元箱根138\nTEL: 0460-83-XXXX\nEmail: info@tsukise-an.jp",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            }
